# Browser
# Fact or Fiction, both seats of it at a page (CR 700.3). On turn 3 Bot1 casts its own: its page asks which opponent
# separates (Bot2, the only one), Bot2 puts Lightning Bolt and Counterspell in the first pile, and Bot1's page offers each
# pile as a button named for what is in it - Bot1 clicks the first and keeps them, the other three going to its graveyard.
# On turn 4 Bot2 casts one, and Bot1's page separates Bot2's five revealed library cards: it shows them in the revealed
# cards panel, Bot1 clicks Guerrilla Gorilla and Llanowar Elves into the first pile, and Bot2 takes the second.

